148 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 112 0 R/E(Hi neighbor, do you love the community spirit of Lakewood Village? Have you ever thought about getting involved but worried about the time commitment? We are looking for passionate neighbors to fill crucial, yet flexible, volunteer roles on the LVNA Board. You don't need a huge chunk of time\204just a willingness to help our community. The commitment is light, but the fun and positive impact are massive!)/Pg 10 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

