152 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 112 0 R/E(That\220s it! You have the flexibility to contribute your skills to a one-year term \(April 2026 \205 March 2027\) in one of these five volunteer roles: President, 1st Vice President, 2nd Vice President, Treasurer, or Secretary.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

