154 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 112 0 R/E(Beyond the elections, this is a meeting you won't want to miss! We are thrilled to welcome Eileen Le, who will discuss several exciting projects under consideration for Sunnyvale. We will also receive vital progress updates on the new Library and the Lakewood Park revamp. Come get the inside scoop on how our corner of the city is evolving.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 112 0 R/E(Eileen will also review Sunnyvale City Council priority projects so that residents can give their feedback: Retail, Sidewalk maintenance, Funding for Nonprofits, Age Friendly, Accessibility and Teen Staff Advisory Committees, Revitalizing Safe Routes to School Program, Public Sector Workforce Housing Feasibility Study, Non-residential sign codes and compliance with the First Amendment, Creation of a Food Co-op, State-sponsored Market, and Streamlining the Permit Process.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[11]>>
